  "prefLabel": "Tax 214.06 Burden of Proof",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Tax 214.06 Burden of Proof. In excavation tax appeals, the taxpayer shall have the burden of proving the volume of earth upon which the assessment was made was not properly determined in accordance with RSA 72-B:1.\n\nSource. #7874-B, eff 4-18-03; ss by #8987-A, eff 9-24-07 (from Tax 214.07); ss by #9538, eff 9-8-09; ss by #10625-B, eff 6-26-14; ss by #13711-B, eff 8-2-23",
